Here is a snippet to wait for the target option to appear before selecting it:
```js
await page.waitForFunction(() => {
  const select = document.querySelector('#my-select');
  if (!select)
    return false;
  return [...select.options].some(x => x.label === 'badlabel');
});
await page.selectOption('#my-select', {label: 'badlabel'});
```
